**.subckt top_fc_cmrr_tb
x1 Balance_Level Vinp voutp VDDA voutn Vinn Iref VSSA top_fc
C1 voutn VSSA 20p
C2 voutp VSSA 20p
V1 VDDA VSSA VDDA
V3 VSSA 0 0
V4 Balance_Level VSSA Balance_Level
I0 Iref VSSA 1u
E1 Vout VSSA voutp voutn 1
* noconn Vout
Bvinp Vinp VSSA V = {VCM+V(Vdiff)/2 + V(Vcmac)}
Bvinn Vinn VSSA V = {VCM-V(Vdiff)/2 + V(Vcmac)}
vdiff Vdiff VSSA dc 0 ac 1
vcmac Vcmac VSSA dc 0 ac 0
